  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="47">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 47</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="47" corresp="#wit-h">XCI. Gif mon forstolenne ceap befehð, ne mot hine mon tymon to þeowan men.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="47" corresp="#wit-e">XCI. Gif mon forstolenne ceap befehð, ne mot hine mon tieman to ðeowum men.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="47" corresp="#wit-q">Si aliquid furtiuum intercietur, non debet aduocari ad seruum.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="49" corresp="#wit-e">{XCI} Gif mon forstolenne ceap befehð, ne mot hine mon tieman to ðeowum men.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e">If someone captures stolen livestock, a slave cannot be vouched to warranty for it.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e">If a stolen chattel is attached, a slave may not be vouched to warranty for it.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn jemand gestohlenes Vieh im Anefang ertappt, so darf der [verklagte] Mann es nicht zur Gewähr auf einen unfreien Mann ziehen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If someone seizes stolen livestock by attachment, the [accused] man may not vouch it to warranty upon an unfree man.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
